  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADDRESSING INCREASING RATE OF HIV AND AIDS INFECTION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy is supporting Care Love Charity Foundation (CALCAF) to undertake a project entitled &#x2018;Addressing increasing rate of HIV and AIDS infection in twelve communities in the Mfantseman Municipality of the Central Region of Ghana&#x2019;, The project will help to improve access to test kits, referrals system and counselling to People Living With HIV and AIDS (PLWAs) in the Mfantseman municipality of the Central region. It will also increase access to testing and counselling services to people at the risk of contracting the HIV disease. The project will target sex workers and their families or associates.</narrative>
  </description>
